    s='r07-ku';form(s,'shangao-ku','山膏（苦山）','Shangao (Ku)','有獸焉名曰山膏其狀如逐赤若丹火善詈','Shangao is pig-like, cinnabar-red and good at cursing.','逐郭注豚字，赤若丹火为色比；四蹄卷尾、耳眼及怒态为解释，不加人面、火焰或文字。','Ordinary pig legs and tail, face styling and posture are artistic; no flames or human mouth are added.',commentary='即豚；字；好罵人',en_commentary='Guo Pu identifies the pig character across 231–232 and explains cursing.')
