    teng=form(s,'teng-banshi','鰧魚（合水）','Teng fish (He water)','多鰧魚狀如鱖居逵蒼文赤尾食者不癰可以為瘻','Teng fish are gui-like with blue-green markings and red tails, dwell in channels and have ancient eating claims.','鳜状苍文赤尾据文，郭注大口大目细鳞；普通鳍与体色姿态为解释，逵是水中交通冗道不补脚。','Large fish mouth and eyes and fine scales follow commentary; ordinary fins, other colors and pose are artistic.',commentary='音騰；鱖魚大口大目細鱗有班彩逵水中之冗道交通者鱖音劌；瘻癰属也中多有虫淮南子曰雞頭已瘻音漏',en_commentary='Guo Pu supplies pronunciation, fish-form and channel glosses; the ancient ailment gloss is separate.',water=True);pair(h,teng)
